node_modules/

# Prelim run directories — preventive: keep stray run dirs out of the nightly `git add -A`.
# Run dirs look like norefXXXX-<slug>-<date>-<codename>, tmp<n>-<slug>, <date>-<codename>.
# (The already-tracked ...-DOC52 dir is purged via a separate ops runbook; this does not untrack it.)
noref*/
tmp[0-9]*-*/
[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-*/

# ...except the serve fixtures, which are named LIKE run dirs on purpose — the reserved synthetic
# noref0000NN form (no-client-identifiers.test.mjs) — and are tracked product fixtures, not run debris.
# Without this line they are silently unstageable AND invisible to the guards that walk `git ls-files`.
!test/fixtures/report-serve/noref*/

# Report artifacts emitted inside those run dirs.
noref*/report.html
noref*/report.client.html
noref*/findings.json
noref*/*-audit.xlsx
tmp[0-9]*-*/report.html
tmp[0-9]*-*/report.client.html
tmp[0-9]*-*/findings.json
tmp[0-9]*-*/*-audit.xlsx
[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-*/report.html
[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-*/report.client.html
[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-*/findings.json
[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-*/*-audit.xlsx
